mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The
proposal, by reason of the site being located within an area of land liable to
flooding and the lack of a comprehensive Flood Risk Assessment, has failed to
demonstrate that the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of
flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding
elsewhere, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies
SI12 and SI13 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core
Strategy (2012) and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management
Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
